er-attachments/assets/aca838d4-0c8b-4d12-b484-7190759ea5a6\" />\n\nBut in Web Export:\n`viewport_path`s are correctly changed BUT all sprites displays the same SubViewport (the new one) \n\n<img width=\"665\" height=\"377\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1b2188a7-452d-49a0-a709-31e6ab43cf11\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun MRP and start clicking buttons.\nCompare debug run and web export.\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nMRP: https://github.com/mborecki/godot-viewport-web-test\nLive Demo: https://mborecki.github.io/godot-viewport-web-test/","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120615/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120615/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}